    "## 3 – Segmentation correctness check\n",
    "\n",
    "Run both the original and channel-sorted SAM on a real image with the same point prompt.\n",
    "Outputs must be bit-for-bit (or float-precision) identical since the permutation is an exact weight equivalence."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "c627b6ed",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "[3]\n",
      "  mask[0]  orig=0.9263  cs=0.9263  IoU=0.998923 <- best\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "data": {
